1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:01,255
Think Git and GitHub

2
00:00:01,255 --> 00:00:02,315
are the same thing?

3
00:00:02,315 --> 00:00:02,978
They're not!

4
00:00:03,898 --> 00:00:05,288
Imagine you're building

5
00:00:05,288 --> 00:00:05,957
a website.

6
00:00:05,957 --> 00:00:07,244
You write some code,

7
00:00:07,244 --> 00:00:08,377
change the design,

8
00:00:08,377 --> 00:00:09,715
and add new features.

9
00:00:10,635 --> 00:00:11,750
Git keeps track of

10
00:00:11,750 --> 00:00:12,574
those changes,

11
00:00:12,574 --> 00:00:13,447
so you have a

12
00:00:13,447 --> 00:00:14,853
history of your project.

13
00:00:15,773 --> 00:00:17,234
If something goes wrong,

14
00:00:17,234 --> 00:00:18,393
Git helps you find

15
00:00:18,393 --> 00:00:19,754
and recover an earlier

16
00:00:19,754 --> 00:00:20,258
version.

17
00:00:20,978 --> 00:00:22,293
GitHub is different.

18
00:00:22,293 --> 00:00:23,827
It's an online platform

19
00:00:23,827 --> 00:00:25,143
where you can store

20
00:00:25,143 --> 00:00:26,074
and share Git

21
00:00:26,074 --> 00:00:26,896
repositories.

22
00:00:27,816 --> 00:00:28,853
Use git push to

23
00:00:28,853 --> 00:00:30,150
send your commits to

24
00:00:30,150 --> 00:00:30,616
GitHub,

25
00:00:30,616 --> 00:00:31,653
and git pull to

26
00:00:31,653 --> 00:00:32,898
bring remote changes

27
00:00:32,898 --> 00:00:33,261
back.

28
00:00:34,181 --> 00:00:35,262
With git clone,

29
00:00:35,262 --> 00:00:36,343
you can copy a

30
00:00:36,343 --> 00:00:37,878
repository onto another

31
00:00:37,878 --> 00:00:38,504
computer.

32
00:00:39,224 --> 00:00:40,218
And git add and

33
00:00:40,218 --> 00:00:41,361
git commit let you

34
00:00:41,361 --> 00:00:42,404
stage and save a

35
00:00:42,404 --> 00:00:43,398
snapshot of your

36
00:00:43,398 --> 00:00:43,895
changes.

37
00:00:44,815 --> 00:00:46,488
So remember: Git tracks

38
00:00:46,488 --> 00:00:48,100
your project's history.

39
00:00:48,100 --> 00:00:49,773
GitHub hosts and shares

40
00:00:49,773 --> 00:00:51,147
repositories online.

41
00:00:51,767 --> 00:00:53,523
Follow Agentoon.ai for

42
00:00:53,523 --> 00:00:53,919
more!
